# One line ending in the repository, whatever the checkout platform: a script
# or an editor touching a CRLF file otherwise rewrites it whole, turning a
# two-line change into a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are left alone: a byte in an image is not a line ending.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
